I started in accounting software, which is the best place to learn that a
program is a promise about numbers other people will be held to.

= How I work

Small pieces, written down before they are written. A project usually starts as
a page like this one: what it is for, what it refuses to do, and what would make
it a failure.

= Elsewhere

This page exists in the preview to prove a point about the navigation: it sits
directly under `content/`, in no section at all, and the theme still finds it,
because the top nav reads the site's own page catalogue rather than a menu
somebody has to remember to update.
